  "abstract": "p=36 variant of the LN model with AdamW + warmup-cosine LR. Fixes LayerNorm API (reduction_axes=-1). Retains MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e-4), residual copy, and V-OrthoReg (\u03bb_V=1e-5).",
